     theta = (1/2) d_t ln det = A(tt)*Derivative(A(tt), tt)/(A(tt)**2 - 1)
     theta to O(eps^2) = -eps**2*a(tt)*Derivative(a(tt), tt)
     O(eps) coefficient of theta = 0
C14_TTTHETA    lhs=+0.000000000000e+00  rhs=+0.000000000000e+00  rel.res=+0.000e+00  tol=1e-15  PASS   theta vanishes at O(eps) for a TT mode: no volume change at linear order

